---
import Docs from '../layouts/Docs.astro';
const code = 'mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-black/60 p-5 font-mono text-[13px] leading-7 text-zinc-300';
const rows = [
  { name: 'SHIPNOTE_REPO', def: 'abhiudayg/shipnote', purpose: 'The repo whose artifacts fetch downloads. Set it to your fork.' },
  { name: 'SHIPNOTE_DENYLIST', def: 'empty', purpose: 'Comma-separated repos to exclude from selection.' },
];
---

<Docs title="CLI: shipnote" description="Reference for the shipnote CLI: fetch the nightly dataset and select the commits worth a post." active="/cli/">
  <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-wider text-sky-400 uppercase">CLI reference</p>
  <h1 class="text-gradient mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.035em] md:text-5xl">shipnote on your machine</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-7 text-zinc-400">The CLI downloads the nightly dataset and selects the commits worth a post. Drafting and review come later.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-14 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Requirements</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-zinc-400"><a href="https://bun.sh" class="text-sky-400 hover:text-sky-300">Bun</a>, git, and the GitHub CLI signed in with <code class="font-mono text-zinc-200">gh auth login</code>.</p>

  <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">fetch</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-zinc-400">Downloads the newest successful nightly run, or the run you name, into <code class="font-mono text-zinc-200">archive/&lt;date&gt;/</code>. If that date is already archived, it does nothing.</p>
  <pre class={code}><code>bun cli/shipnote.ts fetch
bun cli/shipnote.ts fetch --date 2026-10-30 --run 41067258484</code></pre>

  <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">select</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-zinc-400">Reads the archive for a date and prints the commits ranked by score. Merges, lockfile-only changes, commits in <code class="font-mono text-zinc-200">ledger.json</code>, and denylisted repos are skipped, and each skip reason is counted.</p>
  <pre class={code}><code>bun cli/shipnote.ts select
bun cli/shipnote.ts select --date 2026-10-30</code></pre>

  <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Settings</h2>
  <div class="mt-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-black/40">
    <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
      <thead class="text-zinc-500">
        <tr class="border-b border-white/[0.08]">
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Variable</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Default</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Purpose</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="text-zinc-400">
        {rows.map((r) => (
          <tr class="border-t border-white/[0.08]">
            <td class="px-4 py-3 font-mono text-zinc-200">{r.name}</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">{r.def}</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3">{r.purpose}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Coming next</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-zinc-400">Drafting, review, and approval commands. The CLI does not read <code class="font-mono text-zinc-200">shipnote.toml</code> yet.</p>
</Docs>
